Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.60,HOOK,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)\t(0,220,\fs96)}THIS PROTEIN\NCANNOT BE KILLED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.88,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THIS {\c&H0000FFFF&}PROTEIN{\c&H004545FF&} CANNOT BE KILLED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.19,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}NOT BY BOILING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.19,0:00:03.74,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}BLEACH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:05.00,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}OR {\c&H0000FFFF&}RADIATION{\c&H004545FF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.99,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THREE BODY HORROR FACTS THAT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:07.78,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ARE COMPLETELY REAL.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:24.46,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#1  PRIONS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:08.94,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.69,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}{\c&H0000FFFF&}PRIONS{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:10.10,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}NOT A {\c&H0000FFFF&}VIRUS{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.29,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}NOT A BACTERIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:12.53,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}A {\c&H0000FFFF&}PROTEIN{\c&H00FFFFFF&} FOLDED WRONG
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.39,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THAT TEACHES YOUR PROTEINS TO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:15.19,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}FOLD WRONG TOO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:16.96,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IT SURVIVES AUTOCLAVES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:17.79,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}FORMALDEHYDE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:18.74,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AND INCINERATION.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:20.12,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IT CAN SLEEP IN YOUR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:20.71,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}BODY FOR THIRTY YEARS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:22.26,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THEN IT WAKES UP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:24.36,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONE HUNDRED PERCENT {\c&H0000FFFF&}FATAL{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:42.25,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#2  RABIES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:25.02,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}TWO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:25.72,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}{\c&H0000FFFF&}RABIES{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:27.32,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONCE SYMPTOMS START
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:29.73,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IT IS ALMOST ALWAYS {\c&H0000FFFF&}FATAL{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:31.44,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THE {\c&H0000FFFF&}VIRUS{\c&H00FFFFFF&} REWIRES YOUR BRAIN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.49,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}TO FEAR {\c&H0000FFFF&}WATER{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:34.30,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}SO YOU CAN'T WASH IT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:34.85,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}OFF
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:35.96,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AND TO {\c&H0000FFFF&}BITE{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:37.33,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}SO IT CAN TRAVEL.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:38.87,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THE SCARIEST PART ISN'T THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:39.36,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}{\c&H0000FFFF&}VIRUS{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:40.19,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IT'S HOW WELL IT KNOWS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.19,0:00:41.41,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}YOUR BEHAVIOUR.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:59.04,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#3  COTARD'S DELUSION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.25,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THREE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:44.94,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}COTARD'S {\c&H0000FFFF&}DELUSION{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:46.70,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}PEOPLE WHO ARE CERTAIN THEY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:47.39,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ARE ALREADY {\c&H0000FFFF&}DEAD{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.39,0:00:49.16,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THAT THEIR ORGANS ARE {\c&H0000FFFF&}ROTTING{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.65,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THAT THEY DON'T NEED TO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:51.10,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}EAT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.83,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}BRAIN SCANS SHOW THE FACE-RECOGNITION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.83,0:00:54.94,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}CIRCUIT DISCONNECTED FROM EMOTION.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:56.44,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONE PATIENT ASKED TO BE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:57.76,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}TAKEN TO THE {\c&H0000FFFF&}CEMETERY{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:00:58.90,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}TO FEEL AT HOME.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.69,HOOK,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)\t(0,220,\fs96)}FOLLOW — PT.3\NIS YOUR HOUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:00.14,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}FOLLOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:01.93,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}PART THREE IS ABOUT YOUR
